  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Regional Migration Management: UK-Kenya Remittances</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to reducing the cost of sending remittances for the targeted Kenyan diaspora in the UK, in order to maximise the benefits and positive impact of remittances. IOM will work with both sending and receiving communities to pilot approaches to address the identified barriers and gaps to reduce costs for targeted beneficiaries, increase access to lower cost options, and enhance the efficiency of remittance transfers between the UK and Kenya.  IOM will take a whole-corridor approach, leveraging its capacity and expertise both in engaging with diaspora and with financial industry stakeholders in the sending country (UK) and working with receiving communities in Kenya, as well as with government and policy makers.</narrative>
  </description>
